    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/automobile-rental/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Automobile Rental Theme is a dynamic and versatile solution designed for car hire companies, auto rental platforms, and diverse vehicle leasing services. Ideal for businesses specializing in pickup truck rental, minivan rental, limousine rental, wedding car rental, classic car hire, luxury car rental, and adventure vehicle services, it supports offerings such as 4×4 rental, off-road vehicle rental, campervan hire, RV rental, motorhome leasing, road trip vehicles, fleet management, economy car rental, budget car rental, airport car rental, city car rental, local car rental, outstation car rental, one way car rental, round trip car rental, daily car rental, weekly car rental, monthly car rental, long term car rental, short term car rental, unlimited mileage car rental, chauffeur car rental, self drive car rental, and ride-sharing car rentals. With an intuitive interface, this theme enables on-demand vehicle booking, peer-to-peer rentals, motorcycle hire, electric scooter rental, bike leasing, moving truck rental, and towing vehicle services. The visually modern design features responsive layouts, crisp typography, and high-resolution imagery to highlight your fleet professionally. Optimized for speed, SEO, and seamless navigation across all devices, it delivers a superior user experience. Enhanced with booking features like GPS-enabled car rental, baby seat rental, chauffeur services, and additional driver options, it also caters to premium services including Mercedes rental, Tesla rental, BMW hire, Audi leasing, Jeep adventures, and eco-friendly vehicles. The theme integrates with the Shortcodes Ultimate plugin, allowing easy customization and content structuring. Whether you’re offering daily rentals, hourly car booking, or long-term leasing, the Automobile Rental Theme offers a complete platform that promotes trust, functionality, and style for modern mobility businesses."
    },
